      "role": "user",
      "content": "<|channel>thought\n<channel|>That's a good start. I want to dive deeper into the \"democratization\" part. Like, can you explain how the gains made by unions specifically prevented the US from becoming more of a corporate-controlled oligarchy? I'm trying to show how the union movement was essentially the primary defense against that kind of thing.",
